-- Bangalore and Mangalore CBSE/ICSE Schools Seed Fixture
-- Generated via Apify Google Maps Scraper (compass/crawler-google-places)
-- Idempotent and deterministic local/dev seed fixture
--
-- NOTE (issue #1737): the area_key column below is INERT. The V80 BEFORE INSERT trigger
-- (backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/V80__school_area_key_trigger.sql) OVERWRITES
-- area_key with a freshly-computed nearest-area value on every INSERT — the literal written
-- here is never what ends up stored once V106's finer area catalogue is present. The
-- DATABASE ROW (schools.area_key), not this file, is the source of truth; the corrective
-- migration V109__correct_bengaluru_school_area_keys.sql operates on the DB row directly.
-- The 5 area_key literals below were updated to match V109's corrected values purely so this
-- file does not keep encoding the stale, disproven attribution and mislead a future engineer.
-- Do NOT "fix" any future area_key drift by re-running this seed against a V106-present
-- database: its `ON CONFLICT ... DO UPDATE` touches latitude/longitude, which RE-FIRES the
-- V80 trigger and re-derives EVERY Bengaluru school against the full 313-area catalogue —
-- measured to collapse curated per-area school counts from 32 to 6 (see bug-repro-report.toml).

-- #1828 AC7: latitude, longitude AND area_key are deliberately EXCLUDED from this
-- DO UPDATE SET. Writing latitude/longitude would re-fire the V80 trigger and re-derive
-- area_key against the full 313-area catalogue — measured to collapse curated per-area
-- school counts from 32 to 6 (see bug-repro-report.toml). Writing area_key directly would
-- re-impose the coarse, disproven #1737 attribution (this file's literals for the 27
-- schools untouched by V109 ARE the historical coarse values — 0 mismatches/27, measured).
-- A re-run of this fixture is therefore attribution-neutral in EITHER direction: it can
-- neither re-derive nor overwrite a durable correction.
ON CONFLICT (udise_code) WHERE udise_code IS NOT NULL DO UPDATE SET
    name = EXCLUDED.name,
    board = EXCLUDED.board,
    board_type = EXCLUDED.board_type,
    address = EXCLUDED.address,
    prominence_tier = EXCLUDED.prominence_tier;
